    "A switch for an older app copy does not necessarily approve this build. Quit other copies. Remove the old entry with −, click +, and add the exact app above again. If macOS asks you to quit and reopen, finish or cancel any running task, quit from %@’s menu bar, then reopen this same app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A switch for an older app copy does not necessarily approve this build. Quit other copies. Remove the old entry with −, click +, and add the exact app above again. If macOS asks you to quit and reopen, finish or cancel any running task, quit from %@’s menu bar, then reopen this same app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tiny home for the files you’re moving between apps. Drop them at the top of your screen, make a quick edit, then send them on.": {
