    "Choose WhatsApp, then tap Send. With Accessibility confirmed, %@ opens WhatsApp, prepares the files as documents and opens its recipient picker. Search or select your contacts there, then press WhatsApp’s Send yourself. %@ never chooses recipients or sends a message for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Choose WhatsApp, then tap Send. With Accessibility confirmed, %1$@ opens WhatsApp, prepares the files as documents and opens its recipient picker. Search or select your contacts there, then press WhatsApp’s Send yourself. %2$@ never chooses recipients or sends a message for you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
