    "Tap a card for its actions. Hold Command and click more cards to select several files for sharing or PDF merging. Drag cards back into Finder or another app. The × removes a card from the shelf; it does not delete the original.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap a card for its actions. Hold Command and click more cards to select several files for sharing or PDF merging. Drag cards back into Finder or another app. The × removes a card from the shelf; it does not delete the original."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a card, then an action chip. Images can be converted, compressed, resized or stripped of metadata. PDFs can be compressed, split, merged with selected PDFs, or read as text. Any file can be zipped, revealed in Finder or copied as a path.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap a card, then an action chip. Images can be converted, compressed, resized or stripped of metadata. PDFs can be compressed, split, merged with selected PDFs, or read as text. Any file can be zipped, revealed in Finder or copied as a path."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a card’s forward arrow, or select several cards and use Send. The tray lists compatible macOS sharing services. More opens the full system picker; Copy puts files on the clipboard, and Save to saves a copy. Installed apps decide which services and file types they support.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap a card’s forward arrow, or select several cards and use Send. The tray lists compatible macOS sharing services. More opens the full system picker; Copy puts files on the clipboard, and Save to saves a copy. Installed apps decide which services and file types they support."
          }
        }
      }
    },
